flowchart LR
  Web[Alfred WebView request] --> Gate{Packaged exact origin permitted?}
  Gate -->|No| Block[Blocked before network traffic]
  Gate -->|Yes: API / OPTIONS as appropriate| HA[Your HTTPS HA endpoint]
  HA --> Auth{Valid scoped client token for private operation?}
  Auth -->|No| Reject[Authentication failure]
  Auth -->|Yes| Response[API result + explicit CORS headers]
  Response --> CORS{Browser preflight / response requirements satisfied?}
  CORS -->|Yes| Client[Readable client result]
  CORS -->|No| Error[Browser network / CORS failure]
  Setting[Editing a runtime URL] -.->|Does not change| Gate
